  "text": "On Mars, the night can fall to minus 90 degrees. Could a robot survive one? Batteries hate deep cold, like your phone on a frozen day, so rovers burn power just to keep their insides warm. In 2009, Spirit got stuck and couldn't catch the winter sun. The full film, Could a Robot Survive on Mars?",
